flowchart TD
  A[INTENT] --> B[SELF_APPLY]
  B --> C[LIVE_STATE]
  C --> D[DISCOVER]
  D --> E[MODEL_PROBLEM]
  E --> F[EXPAND while INFORMATION_GAIN > 0]
  F --> G[COMPRESS]
  G --> H[RECONCILE_EXISTING]
  H --> I[PLAN_MINIMAL_DELTA]
  I --> J[PARALLEL READ_ONLY PERCEPTION]
  J --> K[ONE_WRITER_EXECUTE]
  K --> L[EVIDENCE]
  L --> M[COUNTERPROOF]
  M --> N{MATERIAL_RESIDUAL?}
  N -- YES --> O[REMEDIATE_MINIMAL]
  O --> K
  N -- NO --> P[LEARN if future behavior changes]
  P --> Q{FIXED_POINT?}
  Q -- NO --> C
  Q -- YES --> R[RETURN]
